DreamInputKeySelector:bAllowGamepadKeys {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:bAllowGamepadKeys
    src   "Whether a PAD key can become the binding -- UMG's bAllowGamepadKeys.\n\nOn by default, because that is what this selector has always done: the capture agent binds\nevery non-axis, non-mouse key, and a pad's face buttons are exactly that. Off, a pad key is\nneither bound nor consumed -- the selector stays armed, waiting for a keyboard key, and the\npad press goes on to whatever else wanted it. That is UMG's behaviour and the only one that\nleaves a keyboard-only binding screen usable with a controller in hand.\n\nThe escape keys are checked FIRST and are not subject to this: the pad's B is one of them by\ndefault, and a selector that refused to look at pad keys at all would have no way out on a pad."
    text  "手柄按键能否成为绑定——即UMG的bAllowGamepadKeys。\n\n默认开启，因为这个选择器一直如此：捕获代理会绑定\n所有非轴、非鼠标的按键，而手柄的面键恰恰就是。关闭后，手柄按键\n既不会被绑定也不会被消费——选择器保持待命，等待键盘按键，而\n手柄按下会继续传给其他需要它的地方。这是UMG的行为，也是唯一\n能让纯键盘绑定界面在手握手柄时仍然可用的行为。\n\n退出键会最先检查，且不受此项影响：手柄的B键默认就是\n其中之一，而一个完全拒绝检视手柄按键的选择器，在手柄上就无路可退。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:bAllowModifierKeys {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:bAllowModifierKeys
    src   "Whether a captured key takes the modifiers held with it.\n\nOn, Ctrl held while G is pressed binds Ctrl+G, and a modifier pressed ALONE binds nothing --\nit is consumed and the control stays armed, waiting for the key the player is reaching for.\nOff, every capture is the bare key and a modifier binds itself like any other.\n\nOnly the CAPTURE path reads this. NotifyKeyPressed and NotifyChordPressed are fed by a project\nthat already knows what was held, so they say so themselves rather than being second-guessed."
    text  "捕获的按键是否携带同时按下的修饰键。\n\n开启时，按住Ctrl再按G会绑定Ctrl+G，而单独按下修饰键不会绑定任何内容——\n它被消费，控件保持待命，等待玩家真正想按的键。\n关闭时，每次捕获都是裸按键，修饰键也会像其他按键一样绑定自身。\n\n只有捕获路径读取此项。NotifyKeyPressed和NotifyChordPressed由已经知道按下了什么的项目\n喂入，因此它们自己会说明，而不被二次猜测。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:bCaptureKeysWhileListening {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:bCaptureKeysWhileListening
    src   "Whether arming also listens for the key itself.\n\nOn, the control spawns an input agent for exactly as long as it is armed -- an actor whose\nInputComponent is pushed on top of the OWNING player's input stack, with every key the selector\nmay bind bound on it (a pad key a keyboard-only selector refuses is left unbound, so it goes on to\nwhatever else wanted it). It is created on arming and destroyed on disarming, so nothing is\nintercepted at any other moment: a key binder that consumed keys while idle would be a key binder\nnobody could play past.\n\nKeyboard and gamepad only -- not axes, and not mouse buttons. A click is how the player arms\nthis and how they disarm it again, so a mouse button reaching the capture would bind itself on\nthe way in and leave no way out. A project that wants mouse buttons bindable feeds them\nthrough NotifyKeyPressed, which takes any key.\n\nOff, the control is state and visuals only and the project calls NotifyKeyPressed from\nwherever it already sees keys. Both were true before this flag; only the default changed."
    text  "待命时是否也自行监听按键。\n\n开启时，控件在处于待命状态的整段时间内生成一个输入代理——一个Actor，其\nInputComponent组件被压入所属玩家的输入栈顶部，选择器可绑定的每个按键\n都绑定在其上（纯键盘选择器拒绝的手柄按键不绑定，因此会继续传给\n其他需要它的地方）。它在待命时创建、解除待命时销毁，因此其他任何时刻\n都不会拦截任何东西：一个空闲时就消费按键的按键绑定器，会让人\n没法继续玩下去。\n\n仅限键盘和手柄——不含轴，也不含鼠标键。点击是玩家进入待命\n和再次解除待命的方式，因此若鼠标键进入捕获，它会在进入的途中绑定自身，从而\n无路可退。若项目希望鼠标键可绑定，可通过\nNotifyKeyPressed喂入，它接受任意按键。\n\n关闭时，控件只有状态和视觉，由项目在它已经能看到按键的地方调用\nNotifyKeyPressed。在此标志之前两者都成立；改变的只是默认值。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:BeginListening {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:BeginListening
    src   "Arm it: the next key fed to NotifyKeyPressed is the new binding. What a click does."
    text  "使其待命：喂给 NotifyKeyPressed 的下一个按键即为新绑定。点击所做的事。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:bEscapeCancels {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:bEscapeCancels
    src   "Escape disarms instead of binding. On by default and for the reason UMG reserves its escape\nkeys: a player who opened this by accident needs one key that is guaranteed to be a way out,\nand a control that will bind ANY key does not have one."
    text  "Escape解除待命而不是绑定。默认开启，原因与UMG保留其退出\n键相同：误打开此控件的玩家需要有一个保证能退出的键，\n而一个会绑定任意按键的控件并没有这样的键。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:bIsListening {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:bIsListening
    src   "Whether it is armed. Transient and read-only, never authored: arming is something the player\ndid a moment ago, and a .dui that could author it would author a control that eats the next\nkey of whatever screen it is on. SetIsListening is the only writer."
    text  "是否处于待命状态。瞬态且只读，从不用于编辑：待命是玩家\n刚才做的事，而一个能编辑它的.dui就等于编辑出一个会吞掉所在界面下一个\n按键的控件。SetIsListening是唯一的写入者。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:CancelListening {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:CancelListening
    src   "Disarm without binding anything. What Escape does, and what a closing screen should do."
    text  "解除待命且不绑定任何内容。Escape 所做的事，也是关闭界面时应当做的事。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:EscapeKeys {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:EscapeKeys
    src   "WHICH keys are the way out -- UMG's EscapeKeys, a list rather than the one hard-coded Escape\nthis control used to reserve.\n\nA list because the way out has to exist on every device the screen can be reached with: a\nplayer rebinding on a pad has no Escape key, and before this there was no key they could press\nthat did not become the new binding. Seeded with Escape and the pad's B, which are the two the\nstandalone input actor already treats as Back.\n\nEmptying it is legal and means \"no reserved key\" -- and then the click is the only way out,\nwhich is the state this control documents as a trap. Left non-empty by default for that reason."
    text  "哪些键是退出方式——UMG的EscapeKeys，这是一个列表，而不是本控件过去预留的\n那个硬编码的Escape。\n\n之所以是列表，是因为退出方式必须在能够到达该界面的每一种设备上都存在：\n在手柄上重新绑定按键的玩家没有Escape键，而在此之前，他们按下的\n任何键都会变成新的绑定。初始为Escape和手柄的B键，也就是\n独立输入Actor已经视为“返回”的那两个键。\n\n清空它是合法的，表示“没有预留键”——此时点击就成了唯一的退出方式，\n本控件把这种状态记录为陷阱。正因如此，默认保持非空。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:GetIsSelectingKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:GetIsSelectingKey
    src   "UMG's GetIsSelectingKey: the armed state under the name UMG gives it."
    text  "UMG的GetIsSelectingKey：用UMG给出的名称表示的待命状态。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:InputAgent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:InputAgent
    src   "Lives only while armed. Weak because the world owns it: a level transition mid-arming takes\nit, and this control must not be the thing that keeps a dead actor alive."
    text  "仅在待命期间存在。使用弱引用是因为它归世界所有：待命途中发生关卡切换会把它\n带走，而本控件绝不能成为让已销毁Actor继续存活的东西。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:ListeningText {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:ListeningText
    src   "Shown while armed. Empty keeps the built-in words."
    text  "待命时显示。留空则保留内置文字。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:NoKeyText {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:NoKeyText
    src   "Shown while nothing is bound. Empty keeps the built-in words, as an empty brush keeps a glyph."
    text  "未绑定任何键时显示。留空则保留内置文字，如同空画刷仍保留字形。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:NotifyChordPressed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:NotifyChordPressed
    src   "The chord-shaped twin, for a project whose input layer knows which modifiers were down.\nNotifyKeyPressed is exactly this with no modifiers, so the two cannot come to mean different\nthings: it forwards here."
    text  "组合键形式的对应项，适用于输入层知道按下了哪些修饰键的项目。\nNotifyKeyPressed就是不带修饰键的本函数，因此两者不会产生不同含义：\n它会转发到这里。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:NotifyKeyPressed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:NotifyKeyPressed
    src   "Offer a key to this selector. THE ENTRY POINT the class comment is about: nothing in this\nplugin calls it, the project's own input layer does.\n\n@return true when the selector took the key -- it bound it, or it was the cancel key -- which\n        the caller must read as \"do not also treat this as anything else\", the same contract\n        UDreamUIActionRouter::HandleKey states. False while it is not listening, so a project\n        may route every key here unconditionally."
    text  "向此选择器提供一个按键。这就是类注释所讲的入口点：本插件中没有任何地方调用它，\n调用它的是项目自己的输入层。\n\n@return 当选择器接受了该键——它绑定了该键，或该键是取消键——时返回true，调用方\n        必须将其理解为“不要同时把它当作其他任何东西”，这与\n        UDreamUIActionRouter::HandleKey所声明的约定相同。未在监听时返回false，因此项目\n        可以无条件地把每个按键都路由到这里。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:OnChordSelected {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:OnChordSelected
    src   "The same moment, carrying the whole chord. Fires alongside OnKeySelected."
    text  "同一时刻，携带完整的组合键。与OnKeySelected一同触发。"
