DreamInputKeySelector:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: two-way bindings synthesize their reverse route against this exact\nname, so a value control carries it alongside its spoken events. Fires with them."
    text  "`<->` 约定：双向绑定会针对这个确切的\n名称合成其反向路由，因此值控件会连同它一起携带自身事件。与它们一同触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:SelectedChord {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:SelectedChord
    src   "The bound key WITH its modifiers -- UMG's FInputChord, and the control's real value.\n\nA chord rather than a bare key because \"Ctrl+S\" is one binding and not two: a rebinder that\ncould only store the key would silently drop the half the player was holding down, and the\nscreen would show \"S\" for a chord the game never fires on a bare S."
    text  "绑定的按键及其修饰键——即UMG的FInputChord，也是本控件的真实值。\n\n之所以用组合键而不是裸按键，是因为“Ctrl+S”是一个绑定而不是两个：只能保存按键的\n重绑定器会悄悄丢掉玩家按住的那一半，界面便会为一个游戏在单独按下S时\n根本不会触发的组合键显示“S”。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:SelectedKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:SelectedKey
    src   "The compatibility spelling: the chord's KEY alone, with its modifiers dropped. Kept as a\nproperty because existing .dui authors it (`SelectedKey = (KeyName=\"SpaceBar\")`) and binds\nagainst it, and because `<->` resolves a property; kept coherent with SelectedChord through\nevery path. Where the two are authored to disagree see ReconcileKeySpellings."
    text  "兼容写法：仅组合键中的按键，丢弃其修饰键。之所以保留为\n属性，是因为现有的.dui会编写它（`SelectedKey = (KeyName=\"SpaceBar\")`）并针对它绑定，\n而且`<->`解析的是属性；它在所有路径上都与SelectedChord保持一致。\n若两者在编写时出现分歧，请参阅ReconcileKeySpellings。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:SetCaptureKeysWhileListening {
