DreamInputKeySelector:SetTextBlockVisibility {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:SetTextBlockVisibility
    src   "Show or hide the words on the face -- UMG's SetTextBlockVisibility.\n\nFor the selector that is drawn as a glyph, or as a row where the key's name lives somewhere\nelse: the face, the click and the armed state all keep working with the label put away."
    text  "显示或隐藏表面上的文字，即UMG的SetTextBlockVisibility（文本可视性）。\n\n对于以字形绘制的选择器，或键名位于别处的行式选择器：\n即使收起标签，表面、点击和待命状态也都照常工作。"
    state machine
}

DreamInputKeySelector:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamInputKeySelector.h#DreamInputKeySelector:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why\nit stays editable instead of being gated on the enum: the old edit condition greyed the\nexact values that were driving the control."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且确实存在样式表时，\n项目样式表优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这就是实际生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不是由枚举控制：旧的编辑条件恰恰把\n正在驱动控件的那些值置灰了。"
    state machine
}

